      "tabName": "README",
      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/README.md\">English</a></strong> | <a href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/docs/README.ko.md\">한국어</a> | <a href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/docs/README.ja.md\">日本語</a> | <a href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/docs/README.zh.md\">中文</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">antigravity-ide-cli</h1><a id=\"user-content-antigravity-ide-cli\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: antigravity-ide-cli\" href=\"#antigravity-ide-cli\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Command Antigravity IDE's Opus directly from the terminal.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Use Antigravity IDE as a sub-agent from Claude Code, Codex, or any other agent.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Demo</h2><a id=\"user-content-demo\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Demo\" href=\"#demo\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Multi-account support!</strong></p>\n<div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/docs/screenshots/screen-recoding-2026-04-20 16.21.50.png\"><img src=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/raw/main/docs/screenshots/screen-recoding-2026-04-20 16.21.50.png\" alt=\"agcl auth list — Multi-account support\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/docs/screenshots/screen-recoding-2026-04-12-02.55.33.gif\"><img src=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/raw/main/docs/screenshots/screen-recoding-2026-04-12-02.55.33.gif\" alt=\"antigravity-ide-cli demo — terminal to Antigravity IDE session\" data-animated-image=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/releases\">Releases</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">Changelog</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Antigravity has moved to Antigravity IDE, and Google now ships an official Antigravity CLI. This project is now <strong>Antigravity IDE CLI</strong> to make that distinction explicit.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Highlights</h2><a id=\"user-content-highlights\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Highlights\" href=\"#highlights\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Transcripts saved per project</strong> — <code>~/.antigravity-ide-cli/projects/&lt;sanitized-cwd&gt;/&lt;cascadeId&gt;.jsonl</code>, following <a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code\" rel=\"nofollow\">Claude Code</a>'s convention. Grep, replay, or pipe just like Claude sessions.</li>\n<li><strong><code>--json</code> streams in real time</strong> — JSONL events are emitted to stdout as each step arrives, so you can pipe them into anything (Telegram bots, log aggregators, dashboards, etc.).</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Evolution</h2><a id=\"user-content-evolution\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Evolution\" href=\"#evolution\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Version</th>\n<th>Approach</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>v0.1.0</strong></td>\n<td>Extension → Bridge HTTP API → SDK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>v0.1.3</strong></td>\n<td>Offline-only — spawn own LS, no IDE required</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>v0.2.0</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Hybrid</strong> — live sync when IDE is running(!), offline spawn when it's not(!!)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>v0.3.0</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Hybrid + quota orchestration</strong> — selective auth refresh, post-prompt rotate, wake-up, fingerprint, verified offline fast-path</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Quick Start</h2><a id=\"user-content-quick-start\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Quick Start\" href=\"#quick-start\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">One-liner Installation</h3><a id=\"user-content-one-liner-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: One-liner Installation\" href=\"#one-liner-installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/main/install.sh | bash\"><pre>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/main/install.sh <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> bash</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Why?</h2><a id=\"user-content-why\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Why?\" href=\"#why\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">1. Legitimately leverage your Antigravity IDE quota</h3><a id=\"user-content-1-legitimately-leverage-your-antigravity-ide-quota\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 1. Legitimately leverage your Antigravity IDE quota\" href=\"#1-legitimately-leverage-your-antigravity-ide-quota\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Antigravity IDE Pro/ULTRA gives you <strong>Opus</strong>, but only inside the IDE.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tools like OpenClaw, proxies, and opencode tried to extract Antigravity IDE's OAuth token for external use — <strong>Google mass-banned those accounts.</strong> Some even lost access to Gmail and Workspace.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>This CLI does not extract any tokens.</strong> It spawns the IDE's own language server directly and replays the local auth handoff from <code>state.vscdb</code>. Account ban risk? Zero.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">2. Summon Antigravity IDE as a sub-agent from other agents</h3><a id=\"user-content-2-summon-antigravity-ide-as-a-sub-agent-from-other-agents\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 2. Summon Antigravity IDE as a sub-agent from other agents\" href=\"#2-summon-antigravity-ide-as-a-sub-agent-from-other-agents\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">While working in Claude Code or Codex:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Delegate a task to Antigravity IDE's Opus from another agent\nantigravity-cli &quot;refactor this module&quot;\nantigravity-cli -b &quot;write test code&quot;     # skip UI surfaced registration\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Delegate a task to Antigravity IDE's Opus from another agent</span>\nantigravity-cli <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>refactor this module<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\nantigravity-cli -b <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>write test code<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>     <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> skip UI surfaced registration</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">While your main agent focuses on the primary task, <strong>Antigravity IDE handles sub-tasks in parallel.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">3. Isolate context within Antigravity IDE itself</h3><a id=\"user-content-3-isolate-context-within-antigravity-ide-itself\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 3. Isolate context within Antigravity IDE itself\" href=\"#3-isolate-context-within-antigravity-ide-itself\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Long sessions in Antigravity IDE lead to:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Context explosion</strong> — cramming too many tasks into one conversation burns through tokens and degrades quality</li>\n<li><strong>Flow disruption</strong> — squeezing in \"just this one thing\" tangles the context</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">With this CLI you can spawn a separate sub-agent, <strong>keeping your main conversation context clean.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Don't cram everything into a single agent. Manage your context efficiently.</em></p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">What does it do?</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-does-it-do\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What does it do?\" href=\"#what-does-it-do\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Command</th>\n<th>→</th>\n<th>Effect</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli \"refactor this\"</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>New session</strong> created, waits for the response</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli -r</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>List sessions</strong> for current workspace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli -r &lt;cascadeId&gt; \"continue\"</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>Resume</strong> existing session</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli -b \"quick answer\"</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>Skip UI surfaced registration</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli -j \"summarize this\"</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>Emit JSONL transcript events</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli auth list</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>List accounts</strong> with GEMINI/CLAUDE quota status</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>antigravity-cli auth login</code></td>\n<td>→</td>\n<td><strong>Add a new managed account</strong> via Antigravity IDE app</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Key:</strong> If Antigravity IDE is running, the CLI <strong>attaches to the live LS</strong> for instant UI sync. Otherwise it <strong>spawns its own LS</strong> with a built-in extension shim — no IDE window required.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">One-liner</h3><a id=\"user-content-one-liner\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: One-liner\" href=\"#one-liner\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/main/install.sh | bash\"><pre>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli/main/install.sh <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> bash</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What it does:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>clones or updates the repo under <code>~/.antigravity-ide-cli/source</code></li>\n<li>installs dependencies with <code>bun install</code></li>\n<li>links <code>antigravity-cli</code> and <code>agcl</code> (short alias) into <code>~/.local/bin</code></li>\n<li>verifies the install with <code>antigravity-cli --help</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Required:</strong> macOS, Antigravity IDE.app installed, Antigravity IDE already signed in at least once, Git, Bun</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Update?</strong> Just run the same command again.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Manual installation</h3><a id=\"user-content-manual-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Manual installation\" href=\"#manual-installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli.git ~/.antigravity-ide-cli/source\ncd ~/.antigravity-ide-cli/source\nbun install\nchmod +x src/main.ts src/entrypoints/cli.ts\nmkdir -p ~/.local/bin\nln -sf ~/.antigravity-ide-cli/source/src/entrypoints/cli.ts ~/.local/bin/antigravity-cli\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/professional-ALFIE/antigravity-ide-cli.git <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.antigravity-ide-cli/source\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">cd</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.antigravity-ide-cli/source\nbun install\nchmod +x src/main.ts src/entrypoints/cli.ts\nmkdir -p <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.local/bin\nln -sf <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.antigravity-ide-cli/source/src/entrypoints/cli.ts <span class=\"pl-k\">~</span>/.local/bin/antigravity-cli</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If <code>~/.local/bin</code> is not on your <code>PATH</code>, add:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"export PATH=&quot;$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH&quot;\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> PATH=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">$HOME</span>/.local/bin:<span class=\"pl-smi\">$PATH</span><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Usage</h2><a id=\"user-content-usage\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Usage\" href=\"#usage\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"antigravity-cli 'hello'                               # or: agcl 'hello'\nantigravity-cli &quot;hello&quot;                               # or: agcl &quot;hello&quot;\nantigravity-cli hello world                           # unquoted — joined automatically\nantigravity-cli 'review this code'                    # create new conversation\nantigravity-cli 'write tests' --model flash           # or: agcl -m flash 'write tests'\nantigravity-cli -r                                    # or: agcl -r ⭢ list workspace sessions\nantigravity-cli -r &lt;cascadeId&gt; 'continue'             # or: agcl -r &lt;cascadeId&gt; 'continue'\nantigravity-cli --background 'quick task'             # or: agcl -b 'quick task'\nantigravity-cli --json 'summarize this'               # or: agcl -j 'summarize this' ⭢ JSONL to stdout\nantigravity-cli --help                                # or: agcl -h\n\n# Account management\nantigravity-cli auth list                             # or: agcl auth list ⭢ show accounts + quota\nantigravity-cli auth login                            # or: agcl auth login ⭢ add new managed account\n\n# Stdin pipe — avoids shell escaping issues (!, &quot;, etc.)\necho &quot;hello!&quot; | antigravity-cli\ncat prompt.txt | antigravity-cli\nantigravity-cli -                                     # explicit stdin marker\"><pre>antigravity-cli <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>hello<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>                               <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl 'hello'</span>\nantigravity-cli <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>hello<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>                               <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl \"hello\"</span>\nantigravity-cli hello world                           <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> unquoted — joined automatically</span>\nantigravity-cli <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>review this code<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>                    <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> create new conversation</span>\nantigravity-cli <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>write tests<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span> --model flash           <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl -m flash 'write tests'</span>\nantigravity-cli -r                                    <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl -r ⭢ list workspace sessions</span>\nantigravity-cli -r <span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>cascadeId<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>continue<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>             <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl -r &lt;cascadeId&gt; 'continue'</span>\nantigravity-cli --background <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>quick task<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>             <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl -b 'quick task'</span>\nantigravity-cli --json <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>summarize this<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>               <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl -j 'summarize this' ⭢ JSONL to stdout</span>\nantigravity-cli --help                                <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl -h</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Account management</span>\nantigravity-cli auth list                             <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl auth list ⭢ show accounts + quota</span>\nantigravity-cli auth login                            <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> or: agcl auth login ⭢ add new managed account</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Stdin pipe — avoids shell escaping issues (!, \", etc.)</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">echo</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>hello!<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> antigravity-cli\ncat prompt.txt <span class=\"pl-k\">|</span> antigravity-cli\nantigravity-cli -                                     <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> explicit stdin marker</span></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Supported options</h2><a id=\"user-content-supported-options\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Supported options\" href=\"#supported-options\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><em>(no <code>--model</code>)</em></td>\n<td><strong>Auto-follows IDE last-used model</strong> — whatever you last picked in Antigravity IDE is the default</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>\"message\"</code></td>\n<td>Create new conversation (single positional argument)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-m, --model &lt;model&gt;</code></td>\n<td>Set conversation model (default from IDE last-used)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-r, --resume</code></td>\n<td>List sessions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-r, --resume [cascadeId] \"message\"</code></td>\n<td>Resume a session by cascadeId (UUID format)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-b, --background</code></td>\n<td>Skip UI surfaced registration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-j, --json</code></td>\n<td>Output transcript events as JSONL to stdout</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--timeout-ms &lt;number&gt;</code></td>\n<td>Override timeout in milliseconds (default: 120000)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-h, --help</code></td>\n<td>Display help</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>auth list</code></td>\n<td>List accounts with GEMINI/CLAUDE quota progress bars</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>auth login</code></td>\n<td>Add a new managed account via Antigravity IDE app</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Supported models:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>claude-opus-4.6</code></li>\n<li><code>claude-sonnet-4.6</code></li>\n<li><code>gemini-3.1-pro-high</code></li>\n<li><code>gemini-3.1-pro</code></li>\n<li><code>gemini-3-flash</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If <code>--model</code> is omitted, the CLI <strong>automatically uses the model you last selected in Antigravity IDE</strong> (read from <code>state.vscdb</code>). Switch models in the IDE and the CLI follows — no flag needed.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Transcript</h2><a id=\"user-content-transcript\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Transcript\" href=\"#transcript\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Every conversation is automatically saved as JSONL — regardless of <code>--json</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"~/.antigravity-ide-cli/projects/&lt;sanitized-cwd&gt;/&lt;cascadeId&gt;.jsonl\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>~/.antigravity-ide-cli/projects/&lt;sanitized-cwd&gt;/&lt;cascadeId&gt;.jsonl\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The official Antigravity IDE does not expose transcripts. This CLI follows <a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code\" rel=\"nofollow\">Claude Code</a>'s convention (<code>~/.claude/projects/…/&lt;sessionId&gt;.jsonl</code>) so you can replay, grep, or pipe conversation history the same way.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After each plain-mode session, the CLI prints:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cascadeId: 8ed28f7a-…\ntranscript_path: ~/.antigravity-ide-cli/projects/-Users-…/8ed28f7a-….jsonl\n\nTo continue this session, run antigravity-cli -r 8ed28f7a-… '&lt;message&gt;'\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>cascadeId: 8ed28f7a-…\ntranscript_path: ~/.antigravity-ide-cli/projects/-Users-…/8ed28f7a-….jsonl\n\nTo continue this session, run antigravity-cli -r 8ed28f7a-… '&lt;message&gt;'\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">When the provider returns user-facing trajectory errors, plain mode also streams those error messages to stderr as they arrive.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">How it works</h2><a id=\"user-content-how-it-works\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: How it works\" href=\"#how-it-works\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The CLI discovers the execution path automatically:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"                      antigravity-cli\n                            │\n                  argv / config / model\n                            │\n               discover live Language Server\n                            │\n                 ┌──────────┴──────────┐\n                 │                     │\n           LS running?            LS not found?\n                 │                     │\n          ⭢ Live Sync           ⭢ Offline Spawn\n                 │                     │\n          attach to IDE's         spawn own LS +\n          existing LS             extension shim\n                 │                     │\n                 └──────────┬──────────┘\n                            │\n                 ConnectRPC (HTTPS)\n                            │\n                 StartCascade → stream\n                 → steps → transcript\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>                      antigravity-cli\n                            │\n                  argv / config / model\n                            │\n               discover live Language Server\n                            │\n                 ┌──────────┴──────────┐\n                 │                     │\n           LS running?            LS not found?\n                 │                     │\n          ⭢ Live Sync           ⭢ Offline Spawn\n                 │                     │\n          attach to IDE's         spawn own LS +\n          existing LS             extension shim\n                 │                     │\n                 └──────────┬──────────┘\n                            │\n                 ConnectRPC (HTTPS)\n                            │\n                 StartCascade → stream\n                 → steps → transcript\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Path A — Live Sync (IDE running)</h3><a id=\"user-content-path-a--live-sync-ide-running\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Path A — Live Sync (IDE running)\" href=\"#path-a--live-sync-ide-running\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Discovers the running LS via process introspection (<code>ps</code> + <code>lsof</code>)</li>\n<li>Extracts CSRF token and HTTPS port from the live discovery file</li>\n<li><strong>ConnectRPC</strong> directly to the existing LS — no spawn, no fake server</li>\n<li>Conversation appears in IDE UI immediately</li>\n<li><code>state.vscdb</code> is <strong>not touched</strong> — the IDE owns its own DB</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Path B — Offline Spawn (no IDE)</h3><a id=\"user-content-path-b--offline-spawn-no-ide\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Path B — Offline Spawn (no IDE)\" href=\"#path-b--offline-spawn-no-ide\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Reads <strong><code>state.vscdb</code></strong> for OAuth tokens, model preferences, and USS topic bytes</li>\n<li>Spawns the <strong>LS binary</strong> from <code>Antigravity IDE.app</code> with protobuf metadata via stdin</li>\n<li><strong>Built-in extension shim</strong> handles reverse RPC (USS auth handoff, heartbeat)</li>\n<li><strong>ConnectRPC</strong> over HTTPS (self-signed <code>cert.pem</code>) to the spawned LS</li>\n<li>Streams agent state updates; fetches trajectory steps as conversation progresses</li>\n<li>Post-processing: <code>trajectorySummaries</code> hydration to <code>state.vscdb</code> for later IDE visibility</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>No Bridge Extension.</strong> Talks to the LS binary directly — with or without an IDE window.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Notes</h2><a id=\"user-content-notes\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Notes\" href=\"#notes\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>If <code>--model</code> is omitted, the CLI <strong>auto-follows the IDE's last-used model</strong> — switch in the IDE, the CLI follows.</li>\n<li><code>--background</code> skips UI surfaced registration (no <code>trajectorySummaries</code> hydration).</li>\n<li>Multiple positional arguments are joined with spaces automatically — quotes are optional.</li>\n<li>Stdin pipe (<code>echo \"prompt\" | agcl</code>) avoids shell escaping issues with <code>!</code>, <code>\"</code>, etc.</li>\n<li>Antigravity IDE.app must be installed and signed in at least once (for <code>state.vscdb</code>).</li>\n<li>If the IDE is running, the CLI attaches to the <strong>live LS</strong>. Otherwise it spawns a <strong>fresh LS instance</strong> (1:1 one-shot).</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contributors\" href=\"#contributors\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This project was built together with AI agents.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/professional-ALFIE\">professional-ALFIE</a></strong></td>\n<td>Design, direction, verification</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href=\"https://antigravity.google\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antigravity</a></strong></td>\n<td>Implementation, debugging, refactoring</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href=\"https://openai.com/codex\" rel=\"nofollow\">Codex</a></strong></td>\n<td>Protobuf analysis, code review</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</p>\n</article>",
